[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0010","text":"今天真的非常感谢！\n辛苦啦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0020","text":"辛苦了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0030","text":"下一个现场，是个没去过的地方呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0040","text":"嗯，我也是——\n最近的地铁站是哪个来着？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0050","text":"是啊\n得早点出发才行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0060","text":"——直接打车不就行了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0070","text":"哇……！\n好多人……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0080","text":"大家都在cosplay——\n对哦，今天是万圣节嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0090","text":"嗯、嗯……\n这样的话，打车怕是没戏了呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_02_0100","text":"…………啧"}]
